# 滴滴
DOMAIN,gwp.xiaojukeji.com,REJECT
DOMAIN,gwpgz.diditaxi.com.cn,REJECT
DOMAIN,adtrack.xiaojukeji.com,REJECT

# 12306
DOMAIN,ad.12306.cn,DIRECT

# Keep
